<title>UK: Wuestenrot Hypo sets 250 mln mark 8-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Hypo sets 250 mln mark 8-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    05.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  100.11    FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTT     DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 73</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
